  "schema": "DF/SOURCE_AUTHORITY/1",
  "statement": "The language corpora are the 22 PA21.2 packages (plus PA21.2_EVIDENCE) exactly as they were on worklaptop1 when this release was assembled -- the folders, which carry the PA21.6/7/18/31 updates, not the older *.zip snapshots beside them. All 22 packages carry byte-identical spec/, reference/pacore and pamath trees; the language was read from PA_Language_PA21.2 and the digests below let anyone confirm the others are the same. None of the corpora was modified.",
